OL,3,GNEWSAFamily allowance extended to cover
OL,4,Aschool year
OL,5,
OL,6,FGuernsey's family allowance benefit has
OL,7,Fbeen extended to cover 18-year-olds who
OL,8,Fare still at school.
OL,10,FFrom Tuesday, families who qualified
OL,11,Ffor the weekly family allowance or
OL,12,Fwidowed parent's allowance would
OL,13,Fcontinue to receive support until the
OL,14,Fend of the academic year if their child
OL,15,Fturned 18 while still in full-time
OL,16,Feducation, officials said.
OL,18,FPreviously, entitlement ended when a
OL,19,Fchild reached their 18th birthday, even
OL,20,Fif they were part way through an
OL,21,Facademic year.
OL,23,APub: 31-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
